483", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 28, "impression_count": 65307, "like_count": 644, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 9, "retweet_count": 22}, "text": "https://t.co/nV74zJ815n https://t.co/d8PO4Y3eH0", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2120646463059640483"}, {"author_id": "2939913921", "created_at": "2026-11-11T22:26:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120644428943753344"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/thestalwart/st…", "end": 149, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/thestalwart/status/2120637473252364379", "start": 126, "url": "https://t.co/2oH8b1QDQA"}]}, "id": "2120644428943753344", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 29, "impression_count": 27742, "like_count": 169, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 6, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Is there precedent of someone not going down with this big of a blast radius? (Without controlling founder shares,etc) \n\nRip. https://t.co/2oH8b1QDQA", "url": "https://x.com/natolambert/status/2120644428943753344"}, {"author_id": "985281530070265862", "created_at": "2026-11-11T20:40:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120617704101155270"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/5F8BylIhuG", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/dylan522p/status/2120617704101155270/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120617700804464640", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/5F8BylIhuG"}]}, "id": "2120617704101155270", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 523, "impression_count": 157066, "like_count": 1319, "quote_count": 89, "reply_count": 202, "retweet_count": 72}, "text": "Persistent Agents are the next unlock of AI usage\nOur spend on AI is now 45% persistent agents\nUnfortunately for Anthropic, Claude Tags sucks\nOpenAI's Slack agent is even worse\nWe primarily use Perplexity Computer, which uses a lot of different models\nPerplexity's Harness mogs https://t.co/5F8BylIhuG", "url": "https://x.com/dylan522p/status/2120617704101155270"}, {"author_id": "2465283662", "created_at": "2026-11-11T20:09:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120609882663780777"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Join the discussion on this paper page", "display_url": "huggingface.co/papers/2611.12…", "end": 90, "expanded_url": "https://huggingface.co/papers/2611.12885", "images": [{"height": 648, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120609398448078848/GRO2FzuY?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2120609398448078848/GRO2FzuY?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 67, "status": 200, "title": "Paper page - World In-Context Learning for Agentic Robot Manipulation", "unwound_url": "https://huggingface.co/papers/2611.12885", "url": "https://t.co/kv7KCvTYmu"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/qKsbFjdnR8", "end": 114, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/_akhaliq/status/2120609882663780777/video/1", "media_key": "13_2120609829987434496", "start": 91, "url": "https://t.co/qKsbFjdnR8"}]}, "id": "2120609882663780777", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 103, "impression_count": 16778, "like_count": 133, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 12, "retweet_count": 11}, "text": "World In-Context Learning for Agentic Robot Manipulation  \n\npaper: https://t.co/kv7KCvTYmu https://t.co/qKsbFjdnR8", "url": "https://x.com/_akhaliq/status/2120609882663780777"}, {"author_id": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-11-11T18:03:20.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120578135594791297"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/8MpwD9xGFV", "end": 295, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2120578135594791297/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120578133321469952", "start": 272, "url": "https://t.co/8MpwD9xGFV"}]}, "id": "2120578135594791297", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 52, "impression_count": 46158, "like_count": 329, "quote_count": 6, "reply_count": 32, "retweet_count": 12}, "text": "Google has unveiled TPU 8i Max, aka Whalefish. One interesting detail is that the announcement confirms the 8i Max will have 384GB of HBM per chip, meaning it moves to 8-hi HBM compared to the 12-hi HBM used for the original TPU 8i, which we reported to Accelerator Model https://t.co/8MpwD9xGFV", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2120578135594791297"}, {"author_id": "1482581556", "created_at": "2026-11-11T17:12:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120565316619284734"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Programmatic access to the AlphaGenome family of models and the AlphaGenome Atlas, developed by Google DeepMind. Predict the regulatory effects of DNA sequences and genetic variants, or query pre-computed variant effects across the human genome. Our latest model. Improved cell-type specificity and generalizes to your own scRNA-seq data. Imputes unobserved modalities. Genome-wide in silico mutagenesis across 9 billion variants, with pre-computed scores and the AlphaGenome Variant Impact (AVI) score for", "display_url": "alphagenomedocs.com", "end": 278, "expanded_url": "https://www.alphagenomedocs.com/", "start": 255, "status": 200, "title": "AlphaGenome documentation — AlphaGenome", "unwound_url": "https://www.alphagenomedocs.com/", "url": "https://t.co/dEyrvpTxIl"}, {"display_url": "x.com/GoogleDeepMind…", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/GoogleDeepMind/status/2120532824465805749", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/3pLBKJSyFz"}]}, "id": "2120565316619284734", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 564, "impression_count": 174073, "like_count": 3457, "quote_count": 78, "reply_count": 199, "retweet_count": 434}, "text": "Super proud to announce AlphaGenome 2 - our new DNA sequence model! 🧬 It predicts the impact of DNA variants in different specific cell types - unlocking crucial information for understanding complex diseases. Available for academic research via our API: https://t.co/dEyrvpTxIl https://t.co/3pLBKJSyFz", "url": "https://x.com/demishassabis/status/2120565316619284734"}, {"author_id": "4783690002", "created_at": "2026-11-11T15:03:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120532824465805749"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/CkpKgsutf3", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/GoogleDeepMind/status/2120532824465805749/video/1", "media_key": "13_2120531931515219969", "start": 274, "url": "https://t.co/CkpKgsutf3"}]}, "id": "2120532824465805749", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1144, "impression_count": 460377, "like_count": 2925, "quote_count": 241, "reply_count": 259, "retweet_count": 454}, "text": "Your heart, brain, and immune system share the same DNA sequence. So how can a single-letter change affect disease in some cells, while sparing the rest?\n\nAlphaGenome 2 is our new AI model that zooms in on specific cells to help scientists understand what drives disease. 🧵 https://t.co/CkpKgsutf3", "url": "https://x.com/GoogleDeepMind/status/2120532824465805749"}, {"author_id": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-11-11T15:03:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120532776403247464"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 49, "id": "1994288895320838149", "start": 40, "username": "radixark"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/kPUMhPEGvL", "end": 158, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2120532776403247464/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120532773450469377", "start": 135, "url": "https://t.co/kPUMhPEGvL"}]}, "id": "2120532776403247464", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 53, "impression_count": 37047, "like_count": 416, "quote_count": 4, "reply_count": 22, "retweet_count": 16}, "text": "MOG ALERT🚨: NVIDIA, in partnership with @radixark, has just improved SGLang Rubin performance again by up to 10x in less than 5 days!! https://t.co/kPUMhPEGvL", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2120532776403247464"}, {"author_id": "4783690002", "created_at": "2026-11-11T11:50:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120484246401777737"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 59, "id": "142415193", "start": 49, "username": "signalapp"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/iWNJ8UiTSQ", "end": 289, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/GoogleDeepMind/status/2120484246401777737/photo/1", "media_key": "16_2120483699326111746", "start": 266, "url": "https://t.co/iWNJ8UiTSQ"}]}, "id": "2120484246401777737", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 371, "impression_count": 132586, "like_count": 1902, "quote_count": 170, "reply_count": 310, "retweet_count": 211}, "text": "For the first time, AI has mathematically proven @signalapp’s protocol is secure down to the code level.\n\nUsing our breakthrough AlphaProof Code framework, we verified the messaging app’s cryptographic system – which protects billions of private messages every day. https://t.co/iWNJ8UiTSQ", "url": "https://x.com/GoogleDeepMind/status/2120484246401777737"}, {"author_id": "1745106082790318080", "created_at": "2026-11-11T03:03:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2120351564720136389"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/C32phAdHI9", "end": 300, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2120351564720136389/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2120351562853720064", "start": 277, "url": "https://t.co/C32phAdHI9"}]}, "id": "2120351564720136389", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 297, "impression_count": 111099, "like_count": 1103, "quote_count": 32, "reply_count": 52, "retweet_count": 66}, "text": "SpaceX is developing Kessel, a custom Vera Rubin NVL72 rack that replaces internal NVLink cable cartridges with a passive PCB midplane. It keeps Oberon’s 72 GPU packages, 18 compute trays and 9 switch trays, but rearranges them back-to-back around the board. Think mini Kyber, https://t.co/C32phAdHI9", "url": "https://x.com/SemiAnalysis_/status/2120351564720136389"}], "includes": {"users": [{"id": "2465283662", "name": "AK", "username": "_akhaliq"}, {"id": "1745106082790318080", "name": "SemiAnalysis", "username": "SemiAnalysis_"}, {"id": "985281530070265862", "name": "Dylan Patel", "username": "dylan522p"}, {"id": "1482581556", "name": "Demis Hassabis", "username": "demishassabis"}, {"id": "4783690002", "name": "Google DeepMind", "username": "GoogleDeepMind"}, {"id": "2939913921", "name": "Nathan Lambert", "username": "natolambert"}, {"id": "1353836358901501952", "name": "Anthropic", "username": "AnthropicAI"}]}, "meta": {"newest_id": "2120952429093245062", "next_token": "b26v89c19zqg8o3juzovc491l7edneyjoqzfisw6kccxp", "oldest_id": "2120351564720136389", "result_count": 25}}
